<% @title = "New friend request" %>

<div class="pill">Crew ping</div>
<h2><%= @friend_name %>, <%= @user_name %> wants to sync up.</h2>
<p>Lock in the connection so you can exchange invites, swap setlists, and plan the next warehouse takeover together.</p>

<div class="panel">
  <p style="margin: 0 0 6px;"><strong>What happens when you accept?</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>See each other’s invite availability instantly</li>
    <li>Collaborate on private or public events</li>
    <li>Keep DMs organized right inside HappenHub</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<a href="<%= @friendships_url %>" class="cta">Open friend requests</a>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Not feeling it? Ignore and the request will fade out quietly.</p>
